    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Background</h2>Several people, struggling with their lives, took part in the life-and-death game for a $30 million prize.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122230/extras/e6ce7b8226ef2e605aa3e938a3656164.avif?t=1682332210\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2>It's a Roguelike survival strategy game that relies on chance to pick the right glass and strategy to use skills.<br><br>The bridge is made up of 18 pairs of glass, each containing a piece of ordinary glass and a piece of reinforced glass. The reinforced glass can bear the weight of multiple people, while the ordinary glass cannot bear the weight of a single person.<br>Walk across the bridge, reach your destination and win.<br>Select a contestant and click Prepare.<br>Click on the glass in front of the contestant and jump forward.<br>If you jump on ordinary glass, the glass will break and the contestant will fall.<br>Pick another contestant and get ready to jump.<br>A skill point is awarded for each correct choice of a reinforced glass. Players can unlock a contestant's abilities.<br>Finally reach the opposite platform, the victory.<br>If there are no contestants left and the finish line has not been reached, the game fails.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122230/extras/ffd879a1fe13840e33d7407fcbc136df.avif?t=1682332210\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Terrorist</h2>The terror of survival, especially when falling can be felt more.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122230/extras/a25357038a44ce53d19f4cddd851efa7.avif?t=1682332210\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real</h2>Close-up of movie footage, the game has better authenticity and enjoyment.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2122230/extras/8f5ef6e66a97a26a5822105cbb994176.avif?t=1682332210\" /></div>",
